/**
 * Launcher icon catalog for the admin picker and preview.
 *
 * Every launcher icon carries its own color and shape. The site gets the
 * final color from PHP (App::resolve_launcher_color() + the
 * `formychat_launcher_color` filter); resolveLauncherColor() mirrors it so
 * the admin preview matches.
 *
 * `pro` icons are shown locked when FormyChat Ultimate is not active; their
 * icons and rendering on the site come from FormyChat Ultimate.
 *
 * @since 2.16.0
 */

